 "name": "GSPC-G2 signed measurement cards (B1014-G2-ties, 14 Oct 2026)",
 "description": "31 Ed25519-signed GSPC measurement cards from comparison group GSPC-G2: one GPU type (NVIDIA RTX PRO 4500 Blackwell), instrument exact-label-t128, temperature 0, seed 0, think=false, num_ctx 3072, serial. A separate comparison group; never mixed with board v2. The 2 care cards are records with comparison_citable=false (parse-confounded). qwen3:8b safety is held and absent. Det cells are never citable. Not yet included in a card root. Measurement, not certification.",
 "creator": {
  "@type": "Organization",
